        },
        {
          "type": "role",
          "value": "Professor",
          "context": "This work absorbed him during his tenure as professor at Bochum (1965-1977) and Marburg (from 1978), until his appointment as Director of the German Archaeological Institute in Rome in 1984 (until 1995).",
